# =============================================================================
# SGLATrack .gitignore
# 原則：只排除 dataset、checkpoint、log、測試產物、權重等大型檔案；
#       程式碼、yaml、scripts、實驗設定等一律提交 GitHub。
# =============================================================================

# --- Datasets（原始影像 / benchmark 資料）---
/data/
**/python/data/
s3lab_research_v1/python/00_Dataset/
s3lab_research_v1/python/01_Training/
VideoX-master/**/data/

# --- Training / test 輸出目錄（整包排除）---
/output/
**/output/
**/output_vit/

# --- Checkpoints（保險：output 已涵蓋，另列常見路徑）---
**/checkpoints/
**/checkpoint/

# --- 模型權重 / 預訓練 ---
*.pth
*.pth.tar
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
**/pretrained_models/

# --- Logs / TensorBoard ---
**/logs/
**/tensorboard/
/tensorboard/
*.log
wandb/

# --- Test / eval / golden 產物 ---
**/tracking_results/
**/result_plots/
**/eval_data/
**/golden/

# --- RTL simulation / synthesis artifacts ---
RTL/**/*.sdf
RTL/**/*.fsdb
RTL/xcelium.d/
RTL/INCA_libs/
RTL/**/worklib/
RTL/nWaveLog/
*.pak
*.fsdb

# --- Python 編譯與快取 ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.so
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
build/

# --- IDE / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- 本機大型 bundle / 雜項清單（非原始碼）---
software_new/
**/software_new/
allfiles.txt

# --- 巢狀倉庫併入時的本機備份 ---
**/_git_subrepo_backup/

# --- 第三方本機參考（體積大、可另行 clone）---
RTL-Coder-main/
